---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About Sports Performance Psychology"
  description="About Sports Performance Psychology: an educational resource on mental skills, degrees, and careers in sports psychology."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / About</p>
      <h1>About This Site</h1>
      <p>An educational resource on the mental side of athletic performance.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="page-body">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p>Sports Performance Psychology exists to make the science of the mental game accessible. We cover evidence-based mental skills techniques, honest guides to sports psychology degrees and programs, and clear information about careers and salaries in the field.</p>
      <p>Our content is written for athletes, coaches, parents, and students. Everything on this site is educational in nature and is not a substitute for professional advice. Questions? Reach us through our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
